## VM flags tuned for the Lambda execution environment.

## Lambda throttles and freezes the CPU between invocations. Scheduler busy
## waiting burns billed CPU while waiting on the Runtime API, so turn it off.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
+swt very_low

## The VM sees the host's core count, not the cgroup CPU share. Lambda gives
## roughly one vCPU per 1769 MB of memory, so pin the schedulers rather than
## oversubscribing. Raise these if you configure a lot of memory.
+S 2:2
+SDio 2

## Nothing to connect to, and no epmd running in the sandbox.
-start_epmd false

## Slightly smaller initial process heaps: most Lambda handlers are short lived.
+hms 1024
